### ========================================
### SNEAKERX - Simulación completa del flujo
### ========================================
###
### Instrucciones:
### 1. Inicia los servicios en orden: Eureka → User → Product → Gateway
### 2. Ejecuta los requests de arriba hacia abajo (sigue el orden de los ###)
### 3. Después del Login, copia el token en la variable @jwt_token
###
### Variables globales
@jwt_token=
@session_id=visitor-session-abc123
@user_id=1

# ============================================
# PASO 1: REGISTRAR USUARIO NUEVO
# ============================================

### [Paso 1] Registrar usuario carlos_sneaker
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carlos_sneaker",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "carlos@sneakerx.com",
  "phone": "+56912345678",
  "address": "Av. Principal 123",
  "comuna": "Providencia"
}

###
### [Paso 1b] Registrar segundo usuario (maria_runner)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "maria_runner",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "maria@sneakerx.com",
  "phone": "+56987654321",
  "address": "Calle Los Robles 456",
  "comuna": "Las Condes"
}

# ============================================
# PASO 2: LOGIN DEL USUARIO
# ============================================

### [Paso 2] Login de carlos_sneaker → Copia el token en @jwt_token
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/user/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "carlos_sneaker",
  "password": "password123"
}

# ============================================
# PASO 3: VER PRODUCTOS DISPONIBLES
# (Los productos ya están en la BD por Flyway V4)
# ============================================

### [Paso 3] Ver todos los productos de la tienda
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/producto/productos
Accept: application/json

###
### [Paso 3b] Ver productos de Running
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/producto/productos?categoria=Running
Accept: application/json

###
### [Paso 3c] Buscar productos por nombre
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/producto/productos?nombre=Nike
Accept: application/json

# ============================================
# PASO 4: CARRITO CON USUARIO AUTENTICADO
# (Carlos agrega sneakers a su carrito)
# ============================================

### [Paso 4a] Ver carrito de Carlos (se crea automáticamente si no existe)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

###
### [Paso 4b] Carlos agrega Nike Air Max 90 (producto ID=1, cantidad=1)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}

{
  "productoId": 1,
  "cantidad": 1
}

###
### [Paso 4c] Carlos agrega Jordan 1 Retro (producto ID=3, cantidad=1)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}

{
  "productoId": 3,
  "cantidad": 1
}

###
### [Paso 4d] Carlos agrega Vans Old Skool (producto ID=6, cantidad=2)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}

{
  "productoId": 6,
  "cantidad": 2
}

###
### [Paso 4e] Ver carrito de Carlos con 3 items
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

# ============================================
# PASO 5: CARRITO COMO VISITANTE (sin cuenta)
# (Un visitante navega la tienda y agrega productos)
# ============================================

### [Paso 5a] Visitante agrega Adidas Ultraboost (producto ID=2, cantidad=1)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/sesion/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session_id}}

{
  "productoId": 2,
  "cantidad": 1
}

###
### [Paso 5b] Visitante agrega New Balance 550 (producto ID=4, cantidad=1)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/sesion/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session_id}}

{
  "productoId": 4,
  "cantidad": 1
}

###
### [Paso 5c] Visitante agrega Converse Chuck Taylor (producto ID=7, cantidad=2)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/sesion/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: {{session_id}}

{
  "productoId": 7,
  "cantidad": 2
}

###
### [Paso 5d] Ver carrito temporal del visitante (3 items)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/sesion
X-Session-Id: {{session_id}}
Accept: application/json

# ============================================
# PASO 6: VISITANTE SE REGISTRA Y TRANSFIERE CARRITO
# (El visitante decide crear cuenta y mantiene su carrito)
# ============================================

### [Paso 6] Transferir carrito temporal al usuario carlos_sneaker (ID=1)
### Los items del carrito temporal se fusionan con el carrito del usuario
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/transferir
X-Session-Id: {{session_id}}
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

###
### [Paso 6b] Ver carrito fusionado de Carlos (6 items: 3 propios + 3 del visitante)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

# ============================================
# PASO 7: PERFIL DEL USUARIO
# ============================================

### [Paso 7] Ver perfil de Carlos (requiere JWT token del Paso 2)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/user/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json

# ============================================
# ENDPOINTS ADICIONALES DE PRUEBA
# ============================================

### Eureka: Ver servicios registrados
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

###
### Gateway: Health check
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

# ----------------------------------------
### Actualizar cantidad de un item en carrito
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/items/1?cantidad=5
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}

###
### Eliminar un item del carrito
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito/items/1
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}

###
### Vaciar carrito completo
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/carrito
X-User-Id: {{user_id}}

# ----------------------------------------
### Admin: Crear producto nuevo
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/producto/admin/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Asics Gel-Kayano 30",
  "descripcion": "Estabilidad y confort para corredores de larga distancia.",
  "precio": 2899.00,
  "stock": 60,
  "imagen": "asics-kayano.jpg",
  "categoria": "Running"
}

###
### Admin: Listar usuarios
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/sneakerx/user/admin/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Accept: application/json
